  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "basically the index has an issue where out of local view, people who spawn props via gesture will have rotations go at random if the rotation was animated on the gesture. the example i have is my DMC5 Dante model from my avatar world \"good vibes\" that you guys can test yourself if you have a friend with index. to test this you need a friend with index and one to watch since it happens out of local. \n\nso the user in the picture see's the guns normally, but every time he did the gesture, the guns were rotated differently every time for the rest of us. this model has and still does work fine out of the index. if vrc staff wants me to send them the files for the model to test, ill gladly do so\n\nedit: i did also test this with the sword gesture on the model, that had only animated position and no rotation. it worked just fine. as more people get the index, ill be testing with it more if it does not get fixed by then.",
